{"t_ms": 6080140, "conversation_id": "conv_fixed_early_proxy_s1_029", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Vegetarian & Vegan Options\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nThe hotel offers a variety of vegetarian and vegan dishes across all dining outlets. Guests can choose from salads, soups, plant-based curries, pasta, rice bowls, and dairy-free desserts. Customized vegan meals can also be prepared upon request. Please inform the restaurant staff of your dietary preferences before ordering.", "Kids Menu\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nA dedicated children's menu is available at the Horizon Restaurant and through room service. Popular options include mini pizzas, pasta, sandwiches, fruit bowls, fresh juices, and healthy snacks. Parents may request customized meals for children with dietary restrictions or allergies by informing the restaurant staff in advance.", "Food Allergy Information\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nGuests with food allergies or dietary restrictions are encouraged to inform the restaurant staff before placing an order. Menu items may contain allergens such as nuts, dairy, gluten, eggs, or seafood. The culinary team will make every reasonable effort to accommodate special dietary requirements while maintaining food safety standards."], "scores": [0.46175527572631836, 0.6582558155059814, 0.7493594884872437], "filenames": ["29_vegan_menu.txt", "27_kids_menu.txt", "28_food_allergy.txt"], "timing_policy": "fixed_early_proxy", "timing_trigger": "fixed_early_proxy", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": -344, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 172, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
